W: Hail gladdening Light, of his pure glory poured
W: Who is the immortal Father, heavenly, blest,
W: Holiest of Holies, Jesus Christ our Lord!
W:
W: Now we are come to the sun&apos;s hour of rest,
W: The lights of evening round us shine,
W: We hymn the Father, Son, and Holy Spirit divine.
W:
W: Worthiest art thou at all times to be sung
W: With undefilèd tongue,
W: Son of our God, giver of life, alone:
W:
W: Therefore in all the world thy glories, Lord, they own.</miscellaneous-field>
